              "url": "https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45#discussion_r4308319324",
              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Reject calendar years after an implicit RMB unit**\n\nWhen a named currency precedes a wage period, this boundary check allows the token to stop before `年`; consequently `normalizeMoneyValueV4('币种：人民币 2026年1月工资')` returns `exact` with `2026.00`, and `classifyMonetaryExpression` treats this amount-free table label as monetary. Reject a four-digit token followed by a calendar continuation before appending the omitted yuan unit, so a year cannot become an exact wage amount.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "PRRT_kwDOVApLyM6tthxV",
        "isResolved": false,
        "isOutdated": false,
        "path": "lib/material-fact-arithmetic-review.ts",
