        "resolvedBy": null,
        "comments": {
          "nodes": [
            {
              "id": "PRRC_kwDOVApLyM8AAAABAMu8Xw",
              "databaseId": 4308319327,
              "createdAt": "2026-10-18T19:05:41Z",
              "url": "https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45#discussion_r4308319327",
              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Detect attached halving operations**\n\nThe operation predicate covers explicit fractions, discounts, and doubling but misses the common complete suffixes `减半`/`減半` and `折半`. As a result, `normalizeMoneyValueV4('4000元减半')` and `normalizeMoneyValueV4('4000元折半')` both expose the operand as exact `4000.00`, and the scorer canonicalizes it as that amount rather than an arithmetic expression. Treat these bounded suffixes as operations so the base value cannot be mistaken for the result.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "PRRT_kwDOVApLyM6tthxZ",
        "isResolved": false,
