        "comments": {
          "nodes": [
            {
              "id": "PRRC_kwDOVApLyM8AAAABAMu8Yw",
              "databaseId": 4308319331,
              "createdAt": "2026-10-18T19:05:41Z",
              "url": "https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45#discussion_r4308319331",
              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Accept explicit wage receipts recorded as 到账**\n\nBeyond the newly supported `支付`/`发放` layouts, a direct receipt such as `王甲工资于2026年1月15日到账` still fails attribution because this receipt branch recognizes only `收到` and `领取`. Runtime review therefore adds `source_relation_unresolved` to a valid `payment_date`; include bounded `到账`/`入账` receipt wording while retaining the existing owner and full-envelope checks.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
