              "createdAt": "2026-10-18T19:05:41Z",
              "url": "https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pull/45#discussion_r4308319336",
              "body": "**<sub><sub>![P1 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P1-orange?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Treat explicit plural owner labels as collective**\n\nExplicitly plural subjects outside this finite vocabulary, such as `王氏兄弟` and `双方`, are treated as individual owners. I verified that `王氏兄弟2026年1月全部应付工资合计4000元` with `scope: \"individual\"` receives no review issue, and after scope review `buildFactView` exposes `4000.00` as the individual due-field candidate. Reject kinship and other explicit plural labels as collective so a group total cannot become one worker's suggested amount.\n\nUseful? React with 👍 / 👎.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->"
            }
          ]
        }
